35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire. That is a lot.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The taster forms say people are afraid of committing to a whole year at once.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of members do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing individual payments. That is too much.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The quieter members feel uneasy about what their attendance costs them per event.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing money takes six hours, a flat fee might be better.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, if people are uneasy about per-event costs, maybe we need a base fee.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, if costs are fixed, why should non-attendees pay the same as regulars?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Jonathan, the mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations. That is inefficient.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, but if we charge per event, the quiet ones might stop coming.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,A flat fee covers the fixed costs easily. It is simple for everyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,But the taster forms show fear of a big upfront commitment.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,A tiered system could let people choose how much they participate.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Activity-based charging is a nightmare for the treasurer. I have seen the hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,We need something that doesn't scare off the newcomers or the quiet members.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think a flat fee is the most stable. It covers the hall and insurance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am leaning towards a base fee plus event charges, but I worry about the hesitation.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I prefer tiers. It acknowledges the different levels of involvement.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I strongly oppose activity-based charging. The administrative burden is too high.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I am torn. I want to keep it simple, but I don't want to exclude anyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
